      "post_subject": "Hologram in single color",
      "content_md": "Hi Everybody..\n\nI'm doing some experiments with Photoresists. I would like to create a hologram of an object in single color - say in green. I would also like to repeat the same experiment with Stereogram setup as mentioned in Frank's website. I have done lot of rainbow holograms in photoresist plates but this thought is new for me. \n\nAny ideas will be grateful.",
