      "post_date": "Mon Sep 22, 2008 2:21 pm",
      "post_datetime": "2008-09-22T19:21:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "Hologram in single color",
      "content_md": "You could make an achromatic \"Open Aperture\" transmission hologram, and emboss it into green colored plastic. That should work for a stereogram as well.",
